; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 31. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'daC4_kara'
daC4_kara.dialogstring_08A4EF! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]We arrived at Dao, a town[N]that stands alone in the[N]desert.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC4_erik'
daC4_erik.dialogstring_08A580! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: This kind of[N]sandstorm hurts my eyes. I[N]can't even walk outside.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC4_kara'
daC4_kara.dialogstring_08A51E! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: For a town full of[N]slave merchants, Dao looks[N]so ordinary.[WAI][N]Maybe that's what makes it[N]worse.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC3_luggage_man'
daC3_luggage_man.dialogstring_08B1EF! `[BOR:C][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]Are you, by chance,[N]Mr. Will?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No[PAL:4]`
daC3_luggage_man.dialogstring_08B27F! `[CLR]Is that so…? But I've[N]received a package for[N]him, you know. How vexing,[N]how vexing…[END]`
daC3_luggage_man.dialogstring_08B21A! `[CLR]Alright, perfect! I'm[N]delivering a letter and[N]package from people called[N]Bill and Lola.[FIN]Take them.[FIN]`
daC3_luggage_man.dialogstring_08B2B2! `[CLR]It seems like your[N]inventory is full. Dump[N]your luggage somewhere.[END]`
daC3_luggage_man.dialogstring_08B25A! `[CLD][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:0][DLY:8]Got the letter and your[N]father's notepad![PAU:58][END]`
daC3_luggage_man.dialogstring_08B1CD! `[CLD][BOR:C][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]This is an inn for[N]merchants from far away.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_039D0E! `[BOR:1][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Are you doing well? Neil[N]informed us that you seem[N]to be in Dao, so I thought[N]I'd try sending you a[N]letter.[FIN]We heard the gist of the[N]story. Your grandfather[N]and I are looking forward[N]to seeing you come back[N]one size bigger.[FIN]Oh, that's right. We were[N]examining Olman, your[N]father's, luggage. He had[N]written notes about the[N]Pyramid.[FIN][CLD][BOR:1][DLG:3,D][SIZ:D,6][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]I don't know if it's going[N]to be helpful but I'm[N]sending it along. Well[N]then, make sure to take[N]care of yourself[N]            ♥ Bill / Lola[END]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_039E1A! `[BOR:1][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23]I was finally successful[N]in deciphering the ancient[N]characters, the[N]hieroglyphs.[FIN]This might be the first[N]time in the world they've[N]been translated.[FIN][CLD][BOR:1][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23]According to the Book of[N]Revelation, the Pyramid[N]hides the key which can[N]unravel the monumental[N]mysteries of human history[FIN][ESC:C0,C1,C2,C3,C4,C5,C6,C7,C8,C9,CA,CB] The first[N]sentence at the beginning[N]of this hieroglyph means[N]"the sun god rises from[N]the horizon.ˮ[FIN]When I progressed to the[N]Pyramid, I discovered[N]plates with the same[N]characters as these. Then…[N](The pages are torn here)[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC3_man1'
daC3_man1.dialogstring_08A819! `[CLD][BOR:C][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]This is the desert town,[N]Dao. It's rare to see an[N]ordinary child in a place[N]like this.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC8_neil'
daC8_neil.dialogstring_08A61D! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Will…! I'm in shock;[N]I can't believe that I'd[N]meet you somewhere like[N]this![FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: Neil… How did I run[N]into you here? Didn't[N]you become the president[N]of Reuleck?[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Hahaha. I was[N]wondering if we couldn't[N]import black pepper as a[N]substitute for the slave[N]trade, you know?[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]That brought me all the[N]way to Dao.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]The Pyramid is in this[N]vicinity. Couldn't a[N]Mystic Statue be there?[END]`
daC8_neil.dialogstring_08A700! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]I was wondering if we[N]couldn't import black[N]pepper as a substitute for[N]the slave trade, you know?[FIN]That brought me all the[N]way to Dao.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC3_merchant'
daC3_merchant.dialogstring_08A8B7! `[BOR:C][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]Trader: I think I did some[N]good shopping today. I've[N]never seen a rug as[N]wonderful as this. Yeah.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC3_kruk1'
daC3_kruk1.dialogstring_08AC11! `[DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1]Kyuui… kyuui…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC3_kruk2'
daC3_kruk2.dialogstring_08AC3D! `[DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1]Kyuui… kyuui…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC3_moving_kruk'
daC3_moving_kruk.dialogstring_08AB11! `[DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1]Kyuui… kyuui…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC6_snake_panic'
daC6_snake_panic.dialogstring_08AED4! `[BOR:C][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]Do you want to play a fun[N]game using these snakes?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No[PAL:4]`
daC6_snake_panic.dialogstring_08AEF7! `[CLR]That's regrettable. If you[N]feel like it, come back.[END]`
daC6_snake_panic.dialogstring_08AF16! `[CLR][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5]The rules are simple. The[N]snakes come out of the[N]jars, and you compete on[N]how many you can strike in[N]one minute.[FIN][CLD][BOR:C][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]Alright, hit whichever jar[N]you like. When you do[N]that, we'll start…!![END]`
daC6_snake_panic.dialogstring_08AF94! `[BOR:C][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]Whoa, whoa. I guess this[N]guy's very complacent.[END]`
daC6_snake_panic.dialogstring_08B025! `[BOR:C][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F][DLY:2]Okay…! Time to stop…! The[N]number you struck was [BCD:3,AAC].[N]Please play again![END]`
daC6_snake_panic.dialogstring_08B0B3! `[DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3]You've hit [BCD:3,AAC] snakes.[N]Try again![END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC3_freedom_man'
daC3_freedom_man.dialogstring_08AB34! `[CLD][BOR:C][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]A movement to abolish the[N]slave trade has started to[N]spread.[WAI][N]They say Reuleck's new[N]president is pushing it[N]himself.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC3_carpet_man'
daC3_carpet_man.dialogstring_08AB99! `[BOR:C][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]The specialities in this[N]town are spices such as[N]black pepper as well as[N]carpets.[FIN]It's said that even the[N]carpets in Edward Castle[N]were woven in this town[N]for 40 years.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC3_jackal_girl'
daC3_jackal_girl.dialogstring_08ACE0! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2]The girl was silent and[N]held out a paper.[FIN]`
daC3_jackal_girl.dialogstring_08AD0C! `[CLR][DLY:4]A picture of a black[N]panther is drawn there![FIN][DLY:0][BOR:3][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:0]A shiver ran down my[N]spine.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:0]Could the Jackal[N]that was supposed to be[N]tracking us have given[N]this as a warning…?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC3_training_man'
daC3_training_man.dialogstring_08AE0E! `[CLD][BOR:C][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]Have you played Snake[N]Panic? I'm still training[N]for it.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC3_treasure_man'
daC3_treasure_man.dialogstring_08B34E! `[CLD][BOR:C][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]There's a huge Pyramid in[N]this region.[WAI][N]Many explorers have come[N]searching for treasure,[N]but no one has found it.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC7_explorer1'
daC7_explorer1.dialogstring_08A99F! `[BOR:C][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]How does the Pyramid not[N]sink into the sand even[N]though it's a bunch of[N]huge stones…[FIN]It's a mystery to me, I[N]guess.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC7_explorer3'
daC7_explorer3.dialogstring_08AAAC! `[CLD][BOR:C][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]We're explorers. We came[N]because we heard treasure[N]was hidden in the Pyramid,[N]but[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC7_explorer2'
daC7_explorer2.dialogstring_08A9EE! `[BOR:C][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]There's a mysterious[N]legend in this region.[FIN][CLD][BOR:1][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]"The Pyramid is a place[N]for the dead. Only those[N]who have surpassed their[N]corporeal bodies are[N]qualified to step inside.ˮ[FIN][CLD][BOR:C][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]If it's as those words[N]say… The Pyramid has a[N]giant foundation.[FIN]Perhaps you can't go[N]inside unless you're dead?[N]Uum…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC5_slaver'
daC5_slaver.dialogstring_08B3BC! `[BOR:C][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]These women are weaving[N]carpets.[FIN]It takes them up to 40[N]years to weave them.[FIN][CLD][BOR:C][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]They start manufacturing[N]them from childhood,[N]without even having[N]playtime.[FIN]They continue to work.[N]When they are finished,[N]they will be women who[N]passed into middle age.[FIN]Remember this, boy. There[N]are people who are born to[N]a fate like this too.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC5_weaver'
daC5_weaver.dialogstring_08B4C3! `[DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4]It seems that they may not[N]speak your language. But[N]their work continues[N]silently.[END]`
daC5_weaver.dialogstring_08B4F0! `[DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4]It seems that they may not[N]speak your language. But[N]their work continues[N]silently.[END]`
daC5_weaver.dialogstring_08B51D! `[DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4]It seems that they may not[N]speak your language. But[N]their work continues[N]silently.[END]`
daC5_weaver.dialogstring_08B54A! `[DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4]It seems that they may not[N]speak your language. But[N]their work continues[N]silently.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC3_prisoner'
daC3_prisoner.dialogstring_08AC92! `[DEF]The boy does not seem to[N]understand Will's[N]language.[FIN][DEF]Still, his eyes are[N]clearly asking for[N]something.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC3_slaver'
daC3_slaver.dialogstring_08B307! `[BOR:C][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]Hey hey. This isn't a[N]show…! Go over there, go![END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC9_businessman'
daC9_businessman.dialogstring_08A91E! `[CLD][BOR:C][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1F]People travel all the way[N]to Dao to buy slaves.[WAI][N]I came thinking I could do[N]the same.[WAI][N]But standing here, looking[N]at another person and[N]trying to decide a price[AD][WAI][N]I can't do it. A human[N]life doesn't have a[N]price tag.[END]`
